{"id":"ko-a1-l001","level":1,"title":"A1 第 1 課 · 草稿候選","status":"draft","head":"f54704add5039aaa64810bb043c2941dfdb3cf64","branch":"luna/ko-a1-l001-data-20261027","sourceRepo":"stasischen/content-ko","sourceFiles":[{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l001/core/lesson.json","sha256":"66525d227ec3f53b1538833b9281a9cd47f302968c6bb27d704875da77ea0034"},{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l001/core/sentences.json","sha256":"96cd949ca8910bace8914286676cb7752a98da9236c3668d4222c1aec526282c"},{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l001/i18n/zh_tw/lesson.json","sha256":"fe054d2f953ed933d55b6a75453a494f5cdc77edb53893912a8281a4f942f048"},{"path":"content_v2/review/lessons/ko-a1-l001/i18n/zh_tw/sentences.json","sha256":"83ca5847a851407c2cac7f55cb737b5fbc85aac8700c29434a5a5a7ceca50592"}],"dialogue":[{"id":"scene.1","title":"情境 1","location":"","context":"Yuna 和 Minsu 是互不認識的成人，在語言交換活動現場第一次見面。他們禮貌地打招呼、介紹姓名，並回應對方的問候。","purpose":"","turns":[{"speaker":"Yuna","korean":"안녕하세요. 여기 처음이에요.","translation":"你好。我是第一次來這裡。"},{"speaker":"Minsu","korean":"안녕하세요. 저는 민수예요.","translation":"你好。我是 Minsu。"},{"speaker":"Yuna","korean":"제 이름은 유나예요. 반가워요.","translation":"我的名字是 Yuna。很高興認識你。"},{"speaker":"Minsu","korean":"유나 씨, 반가워요.","translation":"Yuna，很高興認識你。"},{"speaker":"Yuna","korean":"네, 민수 씨. 잘 부탁해요.","translation":"好的，Minsu。請多指教。"}]}],"article":{"title":"","rows":[]},"notes":[{"section":"候選狀態","line":1,"text":"Data card state: done; candidate preview only, not user-accepted, merged, or published."}]}
